1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
ARMA ARMA

2
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:03,050
ARMA

3
00:00:23,380 --> 00:00:26,257
It seems I was right
about the world's speed

4
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:28,497
and power exceeding that of Star Platinum.

5
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:33,640
So, there's nothing left to do
but bring this game to an end.

6
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,477
It should have been done ages ago,

7
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:39,913
but I'll finally be rid of
you Joestars once and for all.

8
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:44,640
Using the power of my stand, I
will send you all into oblivion!

9
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:48,380
Now the world will stop time itself!

10
