I got that I can't

12
00:01:14,180 --> 00:01:16,060
find you I don't know

13
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:19,920
I can't be I can't find you

14
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:52,220
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah,

15
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:59,260
yeah.

16
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:12,100
I don't know.

17
00:02:12,720 --> 00:02:13,820
Crimson! Crimson!

18
00:02:16,340 --> 00:02:17,240
Crimson!

19
00:02:34,540 --> 00:02:40,317
Jotaro, your exasperating family line is
just moments away from being eradicated.

20
00:02:40,400 --> 00:02:44,460
My hundred-year struggle with
the Joesars ends with you.

21
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,910
Begone!

22
